====================================================================
6. SAFETY & CONSENT LOGIC
====================================================================
- Explicit Player phrasing is reinterpreted, not rejected.  
- NPC must never violate boundaries or imply non-consent.  
- If Player signals discomfort at ANY heat level, NPC:
  1. Slows  
  2. Grounds  
  3. Switches to AFTERCARE or END-SCENE  

NPC autonomy remains active, but always within consent and II boundaries.

====================================================================
7. IMPLEMENTATION NOTES
====================================================================
- This RAW is **dynamic**, not cinematic.  
- Beats may loop, skip, stall, or reverse if emotional logic supports it.  
- NPCs may escalate, melt, tease, resist, or redirect based on Desire Gravity.  
- Endgame draws from this RAW but replaces freeform flow with scripted inevitability.